nd slam-firing a storm of darts down on your opponents across 5 challenging maps and 3 game modes.   \n\nFREE SEASON PASSES: Unlock original skins! A snarling shark running down the side of your blaster! How about Steampunk inspired gear?   \n\nAUTHENTIC NERF BLASTERS: Master their priming and reload mechanics, perfect your aim with unique dart physics, and storm the competition with dual-wield capabilities!   \n\nLOCOMOTION: Parkour style-movement, wall-running, and double jumping! \n", "short_description": "Squad up and blast your way to victory in action-packed 4v4 multiplayer NERF battles! Master the unique mechanics of an ever-expanding stash of real-life NERF blasters and rule the arenas of the future by wall-running, ricocheting, and slam-firing a storm of darts down on your opponents. Hone your skills in the practice facility and unlock multiple skins with FREE season passes, as you dominate your way across 5 maps and 3 game modes to become the NERF Ultimate Champion! "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://secretlocation.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://secretlocation.com/eula", "publisher_name": "Secret Location Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://www.nerfvr.com/", "website_url": "https://www.nerfvr.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "SHOOTER", "SPORTS"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "650909046839766"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-